Modifications made in this repository include, among others:
- Commands rewritten as GitHub Copilot agent skills (plugin/skills/).
- Agents converted to GitHub Copilot custom agents (.agent.md), with tool
  names mapped to Copilot's tool aliases.
- Workflows ported to GitHub Copilot dynamic workflows.
- Scripts exposed through an MCP server instead of plugin-root paths.
- The legacy/ read-only rule enforced by a Copilot preToolUse hook.
- The live progress pane, its hooks, and usage telemetry removed.
- A live status canvas for the GitHub Copilot app
  (plugin/com.github.copilot/extensions/modernize-canvas/). Its readers, treemap,
  review ledger and sign-off writers are adapted from the upstream plugin's
  hooks/reader, hooks/map, hooks/review and hooks/sign.ts (Apache-2.0).

Original to this repository (not derived from the upstream plugin):
- The /modernize:parity skill and its tools (plugin/skills/parity/,
  plugin/tools/parity.py), added in 1.1.

